        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Liu, Lu. \"An Illustrated Manual for Regulating the Qing Society: A Discussion of Several Issues Relating to 'Huangchao liqi tushi'.\" in Palace Museum Journal (Beijing), no.4. 2004, pp.130-44.\nMedley, Margret. \"'The Illustrated Regulations for Ceremonial Paraphernalia of the Ch'ing Dynasty' in the Victoria and Albert Museum.\" in Transactions of the Oriental Ceramic Society, vol.31, 1957/59, pp.95-105.\nWilson, Verity, <i>Chinese Dress: Victoria and Albert Museum Far Eastern Series</i><i><i>,</i></i> Victoria and Albert Museum 1996 [First published: Victoria and Albert Museum 1986], pp. 37.\r\n\"<i>Gunfu</i>衮服\" in: Zhou Xun 周汛 and Gao Chunming 高春明 eds. <i>Zhongguo</i><i> Yiguan Fushi Da Cidian</i> 中国衣冠服饰大辞典 [Dictionary of Chinese Dress and Ornament], Shanghai Cishu Chubanshe, 1996, pp. 131."@en .

